ChildVault_constructor
  ├── it should set i_thisChainSelector
  ├── it should set i_parentChainSelector
  ├── it should set i_link
  ├── it should set i_asset
  ├── it should set i_assetPrecision
  ├── it should set the CCIP router
  ├── it should set the adapter registry
  ├── when parent chain selector is zero
  │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroChainSelector
  └── when parent chain selector equals this chain selector
      └── it should revert with ChildVault__InvalidParentChainSelector
